    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been having this weird dull ache in my jaw and my neck for the last hour or so. it's not like a sharp pain or anything, just kinda heavy. i'm not really worried cause my chest feels fine, but i was wondering if it could just be stress or maybe something with my teeth? feels like tension.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
