    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i didnt think about teeth grinding. it does feel kind of tight. should i just take some ibuprofen or maybe an extra strong muscle relaxant to get it to go away? i really don't want to have to go to an urgent care or anything if it's just stress.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
