    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks thats good to know. i'm just worried im gonna be stuck feeling like this all night. honestly the tension is making me feel a bit lightheaded too, but i'm sure its just from being stressed. do you think if the ibuprofen doesn't work i should just take a double dose or something? i just really wanna sleep this off and feel better by morning.",
