      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I would advise against taking a double dose of ibuprofen or any medication without consulting a medical professional first. While ibuprofen can provide relief, double dosing can lead to complications like stomach ulcers, kidney damage, or interact with other medications. Instead, consider taking regular, recommended doses and see if that helps alleviate the tension. If the issue persists or worsens, consider speaking with your primary care physician or dentist for guidance.",
      "source": "target",
